~Version Information
VERS. 2.0 : LAS version
WRAP. NO : one line per index
SOURCE. SYNTHETIC : producer
~Well Information
STRT.M 0 : first index
STOP.M 2 : last index
STEP.M 1 : index increment
NULL. -999.25 : missing
COMP. SYNTHETIC : company
WELL. SYN:CASE : synthetic well
FLD. TEST : field
LOC. LAB : location
PROV. TEST : province
SRVC. SYNTHETIC : service
DATE. 2026 10 16 : date
UWI. SYNTHETIC0000000 : identifier
~Curve Information
DEPT.M : depth
GR.GAPI 45 310 01 00 : gamma ray
SP.MV 07 010 01 00 : spontaneous potential
~Parameter
RUN/ID. SYN:01 : run identifier
~X Synthetic customer section
# opaque comment
vendor-key=synthetic
~ASCII
0 10 1
1 -999.25 2
2 30 3
